<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Noto Sans SC","Source Han Sans SC","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 120, padding: '34px 64px 0', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>单一 RAG 的两个坑：答得慢，或答得偏</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8 }}>三层架构不是炫技，是拿这两个坑一个一个换回来的</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '20px 64px 0', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, height: 228 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFF7ED', border: '1px solid #FED7AA', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 84, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, backgroundImage: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #F97316 0%, #FBBF24 100%)', backgroundClip: 'text', color: 'transparent', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>0ms</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9A3412' }}>答偏</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#7C2D12', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10 }}>速查卡秒命中，但问「报销流程」时，一张不到 60 字的卡片答不全——快，却没用。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 64, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 52, height: 52, borderRadius: 26, background: '#0F172A', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>VS</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#EFF6FF', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 14, padding: '18px 24px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 84, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, backgroundImage: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB 0%, #06B6D4 100%)', backgroundClip: 'text', color: 'transparent', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>2.6s</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E40AF' }}>答对</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E3A8A', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 10 }}>RAG 检索完整文档再生成，答案可靠——但每个问题都要等近 3 秒，高频场景等不起。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 12, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '0 24px', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 36, borderRadius: 3, background: '#F97316' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, color: '#F8FAFC', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>0ms 答偏，比 2.6s 答对更糟——用户问一次就走，不会给你第二次机会。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#F97316', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>核心命题</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, flex: 1 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F97316', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>坑 1</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>速查卡与完整文档严重不对称</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>48 张速查卡都不到 60 字，问流程类问题时 FAQ 命中反而答不全——不准比慢更致命。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#F97316', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>坑 2</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>用 LLM 分类意图，本身就要 ~1.4s</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>每次提问先问一次大模型「你想问哪类」，属于负优化；词表路由是实测下来唯一 viable 的方案。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 64px', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 12, height: 12, borderRadius: 3, background: '#2563EB' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 9, height: 9, borderRadius: 5, background: '#06B6D4' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>mfg-agent-platform · 独立开发实践分享</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>08 / 20</Text>
        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 3, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #2563EB 0%, #06B6D4 55%, rgba(6,182,212,0) 100%)' }} />
    </Box>
</Slide>
